ide role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">How heavy is the water?</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c5/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20230422083302\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"How heavy is the water?\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c5/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230422083302\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c5/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230422083302 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/c/c5/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20230422083302 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"How heavy is the water?\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"How_heavy_is_the_water%3F.png\" data-image-name=\"How heavy is the water?.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\">Jenny Eclair</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/I_love_to_squander_promise.\" title=\"I love to squander promise.\">I love to squander promise.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Honkfoot.\" title=\"Old Honkfoot.\">Old Honkfoot.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>How heavy is the water?</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">Series 15</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 20 April 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\">Jenny Eclair</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</a> asked \"How heavy is the water?\" during the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_fastest_egg_boat\" title=\"Make the fastest egg boat\">Make the fastest egg boat</a> task. The title card features an egg on a boat, referencing the same task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hvor tungt er vandet?', which translates as 'How heavy is the water?'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Paljonko vesi painaa?', which translates as 'How much does water weigh?'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hvor mye veier vannet?', which translates as 'How much does the water weigh?'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Frankie Boyle</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ivo_Graham\" title=\"Ivo Graham\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ivo Graham</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jenny Eclair</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mae Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_fun_thing_to_wear_on_your_head_that_you_aren%27t_supposed_to_wear_on_your_head\" title=\"Most fun thing to wear on your head that you aren&#39;t supposed to wear on your head\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most fun thing to wear on your head that you aren't supposed to wear on your head.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_the_most_drum_skins_and_cymbals_with_a_single_throw_of_a_bouncy_ball\" title=\"Strike the most drum skins and cymbals with a single throw of a bouncy ball\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Strike the most drum skins and cymbals with a single throw of a bouncy ball.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_fastest_egg_boat\" title=\"Make the fastest egg boat\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the fastest egg boat. Your egg boat must look like a boat and transport an egg. If your egg boat sinks or loses its egg, you are disqualified. Also, all your materials must start with the same letter and you can't order anything boaty.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Complete_a_line_or_four_corners\" title=\"Complete a line or four corners\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Complete a line or four corners.\n</td>\n<td>3<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-S15E4&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S15E4-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-S15E4&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-S15E4-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pour_your_sand_into_the_other_bottle\" title=\"Pour your sand into the other bottle\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Pour your sand into the other bottle. You must pour your sand from at least a foot above your other bottle. If there is a break in your sand stream, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">15\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-S15E4-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S15E4_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-S15E4_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Jenny and Frankie came first and second in the task respectively, but lost one point each for retrieving a sign with the word \"banana\" on it from the tree instead of the actual banana.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>In the episode's introduction, <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> calls himself the pilot of flight Taskmaster Airlines 154. The 154 is a reference to the episode: Series 15, episode 4.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/how-heavy-water\"><i>How heavy is the water?</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>How heavy is the water?</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920123757\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.118 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 859/1000000\nPost‐expand incl